千二百里，至东都四百里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b965b026-db0e-11ef-a7de-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b965b032-db0e-11ef-8253-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"汜水曲","place_name_jianti_auto":"汜水曲","place_note":"汜水流经河南新郑弯曲处","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b965b033-db0e-11ef-b6f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄭州","place_name_jianti_auto":"郑州","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b965b034-db0e-11ef-bcb7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新鄭縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"新郑县","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b965b035-db0e-11ef-8474-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"滍，直几翻。汜水曲在鄭州新鄭縣界。師古曰：汜，舊音凡，今俗讀爲祀。","note_content_jianti_auto":"滍，直几翻。汜水曲在郑州新郑县界。师古曰：汜，旧音凡，今俗读为祀。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"b965b031-db0e-11ef-97ca-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"許州","place_name_jianti_auto":"许州","place_note":"河南许昌","resolved_place_entity_id":391,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b965b036-db0e-11ef-b742-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...基引还。唐武德四年，李世民击窦建德东，涉汜水，直薄其阵。","source_end_index":188,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a9690bb2-6cfa-5c44-9df6-4cde63be4775","source_start_index":169,"source_text":"显庆二年，幸许州，畋于滍水南，至汜水曲"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...，滍水为之不流。晋杜预镇襄阳，引滍、淯之水，浸良田万顷。","source_end_index":166,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9b5dc903-a1cc-5e2c-989a-00d0f994f798","source_start_index":147,"source_text":"唐显庆二年，幸许州，畋于滍水之南，是也"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"14冬，十月，戊戌，上行幸許州。乙巳，畋于滍水之南。壬子，至汜水曲。十二月，乙卯朔，車駕還洛陽宮。","content_fanyi":"冬季，〔十一月〕十四日戊戌，高宗出巡抵达许州。二十一日乙巳，高宗在滍水南岸狩猎。十一月二十八日壬子，高宗到达汜水曲。十二月初一日乙卯，高宗的车驾返回洛阳宫。","content_jianti_auto":"14冬，十月，戊戌，上行幸许州。乙巳，畋于滍水之南。壬子，至汜水曲。十二月，乙卯朔，车驾还洛阳宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19577,"number":14,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百 (唐紀十六) / 高宗天皇大聖大弘孝皇帝上之下 / 二年 / 第 16 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"b96366ff-db0e-11ef-86e5-a0d3651f611f","year_int":657},"tongjian_id":"b96366ff-db0e-11ef-86e5-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"許州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"長社","place_name_jianti_auto":"长社","place_note":"许州州政府所在县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b977f7c5-db0e-11ef-9d7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b977f7c6-db0e-11ef-b915-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潁川郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍川郡","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b977f7c7-db0e-11ef-a5a8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b977f7c8-db0e-11ef-bd25-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長社","place_name_jianti_auto":"长社","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b977f7c9-db0e-11ef-9f26-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潁川","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍川","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b977f7ca-db0e-11ef-b133-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b977f7cb-db0e-11ef-8003-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"許州","place_name_jianti_auto":"许州","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"b977f7cc-db0e-11ef-8f74-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"長社，漢古縣，屬潁川郡，隋改長社曰潁川，唐復舊，帶許州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"长社，汉古县，属颍川郡，隋改长社曰颍川，唐复旧，带许州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b977f7c4-db0e-11ef-b077-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"許州","place_name_jianti_auto":"许州","place_note":"河南省许昌市","resolved_place_entity_id":391,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b977f7cd-db0e-11ef-a494-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"15甲寅，上幸許州。十二月，辛未，畋於長社。己卯，還東都。","content_fanyi":"十一月十七日甲寅，高宗抵达许州。十二月初五日辛未，他在长社打猎。十二月十三日己卯，高宗回到东都。","content_jianti_auto":"15甲寅，上幸许州。十二月，辛未，畋于长社。己卯，还东都。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19638,"number":15,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百 (唐紀十六) / 高宗天皇大聖大弘孝皇帝上之下 / 五年 / 第 15 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b977f7c3-db0e-11ef-a963-a0d3651f611f","year_int":660},"tongjian_id":"b977f7c3-db0e-11ef-a963-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"許州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"元嗣","people_name_jianti_auto":"元嗣","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"bbc396a7-db0e-11ef-aa06-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韋承慶","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦承庆","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"bbc396a8-db0e-11ef-9992-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"承慶","people_name_jianti_auto":"承庆","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"bbc396a9-db0e-11ef-a0f1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：實錄云：「長安四年秋，元嗣告之，太后令鳳閣侍郞韋承慶推鞫。」按十一月丁亥，承慶始爲鳳閣侍郞。今從唐曆。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：实录云：「长安四年秋，元嗣告之，太后令凤阁侍郞韦承庆推鞫。」按十一月丁亥，承庆始为凤阁侍郞。今从唐历。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"bbc396a6-db0e-11ef-a26a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"承慶","people_name_jianti_auto":"承庆","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bbc396ae-db0e-11ef-b11c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"神慶","people_name_jianti_auto":"神庆","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"bbc396af-db0e-11ef-8f3a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昌宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"昌宗","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"bbc396b0-db0e-11ef-b6ab-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"法，自首者原其罪。承慶、神慶欲準此條以脫昌宗之罪。首，式又翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"法，自首者原其罪。承庆、神庆欲准此条以脱昌宗之罪。首，式又翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":111,"tongjian_id":"bbc396ad-db0e-11ef-b22b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"妖，於喬翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"妖，于乔翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"bbc396b1-db0e-11ef-bd51-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"停其事，且莫推究。","note_content_jianti_auto":"停其事，且莫推究。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":248,"tongjian_id":"bbc396b4-db0e-11ef-99c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"江都縣","place_name_jianti_